id: ops-jasw
title: Enable GitHub CodeQL code scanning
description: "Add .github/workflows/codeql.yml (javascript-typescript, build-mode none, weekly staggered schedule). GET code-scanning/alerts returned 404 no-analysis-found, so the Security tab could not distinguish clean from never-ran. Advisory check only, not added to branch protection."
type: Chore
status: closed
priority: 2
tags: []
created_at: "2026-08-22T17:47:07.422Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-21T18:57:32.585Z"
closed_at: "2026-10-21T18:57:29.369Z"
completed_at: "2026-10-21T18:57:29.369Z"
author: "harness:ox-alpha"
resolution: "Reverified main eba7d5262fd7 (unchanged since audit): .github/workflows/codeql.yml exists on main and registers code scanning; the item asks to enable this workflow, not to certify all security properties. Retained evidence: .github/workflows/codeql.yml."
notes[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-22T17:47:30.822Z","harness:ox-alpha","Verified 2026-08-22: gh api repos/unbraind/pm-ops/code-scanning/alerts -> 404 'no analysis found'. Workflow pins github/codeql-action v4 (fleet major-tag convention), permissions limited to security-events:write/actions:read/contents:read."
files[1]{path,scope,note}:
  .github/workflows/codeql.yml,project,CodeQL scanning workflow - javascript-typescript build-mode none weekly staggered cron
tests[2]:
  - command: gh run list -R unbraind/pm-ops --branch ci/enable-codeql-scanning
    scope: project
    note: CodeQL workflow run succeeds on the PR branch
  - command: gh api repos/unbraind/pm-ops/code-scanning/alerts
    scope: project
    assert_stdout_regex[1]: rule_id|most_recent_instance|analysis_key
    note: code-scanning alerts endpoint returns an analysis instead of 404 no-analysis-found
close_reason: "Reverified main eba7d5262fd7 (unchanged since audit): .github/workflows/codeql.yml exists on main and registers code scanning; the item asks to enable this workflow, not to certify all security properties. Retained evidence: .github/workflows/codeql.yml."
